1.5e5     kb        - bottom stiffness (Pa/m)
1e4       cb        - bottom damping (Pa-s/m)
25        WtrDpth   - water depth (m)
30        TmaxIC    - maximum simulation time to find a stationary initial condition (s)
4         CdScaleIC - drag scaling factor for IC generation (-)
1         dtIC      - convergence check time interval for IC generation (s)
0.001     threshIC  - IC convergence threshold (-)
0.010     dtOut     - output interval (s)
